[
  {
    "text": "Off northern Alaska, sea ice blocks",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.89,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "a satellite signal.",
    "start": 2.92,
    "end": 3.88,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "So how does a robot under",
    "start": 4.66,
    "end": 6.29,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "it know where it is?",
    "start": 6.32,
    "end": 7.26,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "The U S Navy wants to",
    "start": 8.18,
    "end": 9.59,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "watch the Arctic year round.",
    "start": 9.62,
    "end": 11.32,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Its answer is sound.",
    "start": 12.1,
    "end": 13.5,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Six speakers on the seabed would",
    "start": 14.48,
    "end": 16.27,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "hum at nine hundred hertz.",
    "start": 16.3,
    "end": 17.9,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "A glider listens, measures the",
    "start": 18.82,
    "end": 20.689999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "distance to each, and solves for",
    "start": 20.72,
    "end": 22.689999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "its position.",
    "start": 22.72,
    "end": 23.419999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "No learning, just geometry.",
    "start": 24.16,
    "end": 25.97,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "But that humming is sound, in",
    "start": 26.0,
    "end": 29.43,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "water where whales live.",
    "start": 29.46,
    "end": 30.7,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "So the Navy asked permission.",
    "start": 31.48,
    "end": 33.0,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "N O A A, the ocean",
    "start": 34.02,
    "end": 35.21,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "agency, proposed yes.",
    "start": 35.24,
    "end": 36.84,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "Belugas and ringed seals may be",
    "start": 37.96,
    "end": 39.73,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "disturbed, not harmed, and the",
    "start": 39.76,
    "end": 42.47,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "Navy met its past conditions.",
    "start": 42.5,
    "end": 43.84,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "The last Beaufort beluga count",
    "start": 45.02,
    "end": 46.97,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "was nineteen ninety two.",
    "start": 47.0,
    "end": 48.08,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "For ringed seals, threatened, there's",
    "start": 49.42,
    "end": 51.93,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "no count at all.",
    "start": 51.96,
    "end": 52.82,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "You can't measure harm to a",
    "start": 53.66,
    "end": 55.33,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "population you haven't counted.",
    "start": 55.36,
    "end": 57.28,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "N O A A takes comments",
    "start": 58.64,
    "end": 60.129999999999995,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "until August twenty first.",
    "start": 60.16,
    "end": 61.94,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "We know where the machine is.",
    "start": 62.52,
    "end": 64.18,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "Nobody knows how many whales.",
    "start": 65.4,
    "end": 66.66,
    "seg": 13
  }
]